# This file stays at the release that roc-ray 0.11.1 pins. roc-ray's exposed
# Random module uses this package's State, Generator and Generation types, so
# an app that passes them across that platform boundary must pin this exact
# release. Change the pin only when the platforms that pin this package change
# theirs. corpus/packages/http/ follows the same rule.

index.json <- the tarball root, parsed by `npm run build:index` from the
              compiler's package cache. No source is vendored  (Random.roc + main.roc)
verify/  <- ours: one basic-cli app that calls the package, so
            scripts/check-platform-examples.sh measures this tag and the
            nightly above as a pair
topics/  <- ours: random_generators.roc, compiled by the same gate
